    <region left="18" top="11817" width="714" height="179" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="true">Problem 6: Consecutive Batch Reaction Kinetics (A -&gt; B -&gt; C)</p>
    <p bold="true">Model Formulation: C_B(t) = C_A0 * (k_1 / (k_2 - k_1)) * (exp(-k_1 * t) - exp(-k_2 * t))</p>
    <p bold="true">Classic Chemical Reaction Engineering problem (Fogler / Levenspiel) for intermediate yield optimization.</p>
    <p bold="true">Gradient solvers often diverge when k_1 ~ k_2 due to ill-conditioned sensitivity matrices;</p>
    <p bold="true">Particle Swarm Optimization effortlessly finds the true global minimum [k_1; k_2].</p>
    <p bold="true">EVALUATION &amp; CACHING: Model predictions CB_pred are evaluated with '=' to cache results.</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="12015" width="478" height="59" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>User-defined intermediate concentration profile C_B(t) = f(t, [k_1; k_2]) for initial C_A0 = 100 mol/m3</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">t</e>
          <e type="operand">p</e>
          <e type="function" args="2">f_consec</e>
          <e type="operand">100.0</e>
          <e type="operand">p</e>
          <e type="operand">1</e>
          <e type="function" args="2">el</e>
          <e type="operand">p</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="function" args="2">el</e>
          <e type="operand">p</e>
          <e type="operand">1</e>
          <e type="function" args="2">el</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">0</e>
          <e type="operand">p</e>
          <e type="operand">1</e>
          <e type="function" args="2">el</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="operand">t</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="function" args="1">exp</e>
          <e type="operand">0</e>
          <e type="operand">p</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="function" args="2">el</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="operand">t</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="function" args="1">exp</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="12096" width="141" height="154" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Batch reaction elapsed time points t [min]</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">t_consec</e>
          <e type="operand">0.5</e>
